  "description": "Green papaya salad is a Southeast Asian classic, but that green papaya can be hard to find in many parts of the States. Inspired by the flavors of that salad, but using more readily available produce like cabbage, carrot, and green apple, this salad hits all the same notes without sending you on a shopping wild goose chase.",
  "notes": "Notes: Feel free to use more or less red chile depending on your spice preference. You can also keep the seeds for more heat.",
